  levelNumber: 1
  internalName: downtown
  externalName: PARCEL CITY DOWNTOWN
  description: THE LIVELY NIGHTLIFE DISTRICT OF PARCEL CITY, SET ALONG ITS DEEP CANALS.
    DON'T FALL IN!
  openingHeadline: 'PRIMETIME EXCLUSIVE - parcel city mail service sees surge in
    efficiency thanks to its latest driver, somehow a primetime story. '
  headlines:
  - scientists attempt to explain the high volume of glowing yellow spots around
    the city.
  - parcel city primetine presents the top ten numbers from one to ten (number four
    will surprise you!)
  - mail delivery driver breaks record for most road traffic violations.
  - diamond heist at local bank "sounds like a much better idea for a video game
    than whatever this nonsense is".
  - mass confusion caused after most street signs knocked down by wreckless delivery
    driver.
  - 'EXCLUSIVE: local nightclub submits noise complaint against rampant mail vans.'
  - parcel city overhead rail system delayed yet again as officials "don't really
    feel like doing it right now."
  - city council urge locals not to participate in annual "throw junk in the river
    day."
  - sightings of a red delivery van "plotting revenge" spotted in uptown parcel city.
  - it's 10'o'clock. do you know where your parcels are?
